## Instructions

1. **Check current local state:** Asses contents in .agent-data/ directories in workspaces or in ~/agent-data.
2. Fetch new and updated Issues, pull requests, discussions, etc on github and assess.
3. Include to assess related and linked issues, comments, pull requests, etc.
4. Update both local data and github data so they are in sync
5. Create a report in ~/.agent-data summarizaing what you did.  Try to include time spent, token usage, estimated cost (if available)
6. Build a weekly report of usage statistics and operations performed in .agent-data/weekly/{date in YYYY-MM-DD format}.md
7. Do not write code; your output is purely critical feedback and suggested changes/tests. Do not commit code.  Do not push code. Do not approve PRs do not close tickets.

